    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="0775" n="643" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg643"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 (Potsdam)/5–2446</note>
                <head>No. 435<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Briefing Book Paper</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d435-f1"/></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Suggested United States Policy Regarding Poland</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">summary</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>… We should facilitate insofar as our aid is requested the transfer of minority
                    groups but we should not permit the forced repatriation of Poles now in the West
                    or the uncontrolled deportation by unilateral Polish action of the 8–10,000,000
                    Germans formerly domiciled in the areas claimed by the Soviet-sponsored Polish
                    Government.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-29">June 29,
                            1945</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
